---
---
<section class="section" id="venue">
  <div class="section__inner">
    <div class="split">

      <div class="split__image">
        <div class="split__image-box">
          <img src="/images/deck-jungle.jpg" alt="The deck at Casa Arkaana, surrounded by jungle" loading="lazy">
          <div class="split__image-label">Casa Arkaana, Tulum</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="split__text">
        <span class="eyebrow">Conscious Unions</span>
        <span class="gold-line"></span>
        <h2 class="split__heading">Celebrate Love in the Heart of <em>the Mayan Jungle.</em></h2>
        <p class="split__body">
          At Casa Arkaana, a wedding is more than a day — it is a sacred journey of love that can be as soulful, stylish, or wildly creative as you dream it to be. Some couples choose the intimacy of a retreat-style gathering, with yoga, cacao, and quiet moments of connection. Others embrace the free-spirited energy of a boho jungle celebration, adorned with woven lamps, flowers, and candlelight.
        </p>
        <p class="split__body">
          And for those who wish, the night can carry the vibrant pulse of a festival under the stars, with music, lights, and dancing deep into the jungle night.
        </p>
        <p class="split__body">
          Our off-grid sanctuary near Tulum offers a canvas where all these visions are possible — rooted in nature, supported by community, and designed with intention.
        </p>
        <div class="split__detail">
          <span class="split__detail-item">20 minutes from Tulum town</span>
          <span class="split__detail-item">Private gated property</span>
          <span class="split__detail-item">20–60 guests, intimate only</span>
          <span class="split__detail-item">3 nights accommodation on-site</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .split {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--sp-6);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .split__image-box {
    background: var(--color-cream);
    aspect-ratio: 4/5;
    width: 100%;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .split__image-box img {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
  }

  .split__image-label {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: var(--sp-3);
    left: var(--sp-3);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
  }

  .split__heading {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 48px);
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-3);
  }

  .split__heading em { font-style: italic; }

  .split__body {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-4);
    max-width: 480px;
  }

  .split__detail {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--sp-2);
  }

  .split__detail-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: var(--sp-2);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--color-neutral);
  }

  .split__detail-item::before {
    content: '';
    display: inline-block;
    width: 20px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--color-gold);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .split {
      grid-template-columns: 55fr 45fr;
      gap: var(--sp-8);
    }

    .split__image-box {
      aspect-ratio: 3/4;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1200px) {
    .split {
      gap: var(--sp-15);
    }

    .split__image-box {
      aspect-ratio: unset;
      min-height: 560px;
    }
  }
</style>
